Third-party software
--------------------
reverse3d depends on, but does not bundle, third-party packages and tools
including NumPy, SciPy, OpenCV, Pillow, trimesh, Shapely, NetworkX,
fast-simplification, Pydantic, Typer and Rich (core), and optionally Open3D,
PyTorch, Hugging Face Transformers, PyVista, the MCP Python SDK and the
Anthropic Python SDK. External programs COLMAP and Blender are invoked as
separate processes and are distributed under their own licenses
(COLMAP: BSD-3-Clause; Blender: GPL-2.0-or-later).

Depth Anything V2 model weights are downloaded at runtime from Hugging Face
and keep their own licenses: the Small model is Apache-2.0; the Base and Large
models are CC-BY-NC-4.0 (non-commercial use only).
